# Reference Guitar Pro tab files used while hand-authoring Song Hero's chart
# data (src/data/songCharts.ts), kept in reference/tabs/. Several are
# commercial/copyrighted songs, never commit these to a repo that gets
# deployed publicly. The extensions are ignored at any depth as a second
# guard, in case one is ever dropped somewhere else.
reference/
*.gp3
*.gp4
*.gp5

